  data: {
    LLM: "Bid Alliance when you have a strong hand but need support; bid Solo when you can likely take six tricks alone. Call a King you do not hold to find a partner.\n\nLead to weaken opponents' trumps; use Matadors (Spadille, Manille, Basta) to control key tricks. In Alliance, signal to partner through card play.\n\nThe privilege of holding back Matadors when trumps are led allows tactical delay. Sequence your plays to maximize trump pulls. As defender, coordinate to deny Hombre a sixth trick.",
